    {
      "text": "Coffee on the table\n",
      "start": 33.78,
      "end": 36.58
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunlight through the blinds\n",
      "start": 38.02,
      "end": 40.1
    },
    {
      "text": "You were reading something\n",
      "start": 42.42,
      "end": 43.62
    },
    {
      "text": "While I was losing track of time\n",
      "start": 44.74,
      "end": 47.62
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a little music playing\n",
      "start": 48.58,
      "end": 51.62
    },
    {
      "text": "From the record by the door\n",
      "start": 52.1,
      "end": 54.26
    },
    {
      "text": "And I don't need a single thing\n",
      "start": 54.26,
      "end": 57.78
    },
    {
      "text": "That I don't already have anymore\n",
      "start": 58.26,
      "end": 61.38
    },
    {
      "text": "The world keeps turning faster\n",
      "start": 62.44,
      "end": 65.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Everybody's chasing something new\n",
      "start": 65.4,
      "end": 68.36
    },
    {
      "text": "But I found a little heaven\n",
      "start": 70.68,
      "end": 72.04
    },
    {
      "text": "In an afternoon with you\n",
      "start": 72.52,
      "end": 76.84
    },
    {
      "text": "You're my golden hour love\n",
      "start": 76.84,
      "end": 78.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Like the sunlight from above\n",
      "start": 78.28,
      "end": 82.68
    },
    {
      "text": "When the whole world gets too loud\n",
      "start": 84.04,
      "end": 86.2
    },
    {
      "text": "You're the place where I slow down\n",
      "start": 87.56,
