    },
    {
      "text": "You're my golden hour love\n",
      "start": 90.26,
      "end": 93.3
    },
    {
      "text": "And I can't get enough\n",
      "start": 93.3,
      "end": 96.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Every ordinary day\n",
